{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The award-winning series Disciples introduced a milestone in the game's very successful history; the introduction of a new race: The Elves. The Elven Race added a new dimension to the game and added countless hours of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t   Now that series has expanded further with Disciples II: Rise Of The Elves. This version features all of the campaigns found in the original and a brand new campaign that continues the storyline of the Elven Race. It also includes 14 new skirmish maps to test hone your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\t\t\t\t   <strong>Key features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New campaign that continues the Elven Storyline</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t    14 new skirmish maps to test gamer's skills  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t    5 playable races to choose from; the Empire; the Undead Hordes, the Mountain Clans, the Legions of the Damned, and the Elven Alliance </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t    The Elven tech tree allows players to choose between Noble or Wild Elves increasing replayability </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t    Over 200 individually animated unit types and over 100 different spells </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t    Scenario editor to create your own adventures  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t    Battle friends and enemies in multiplayer over LAN, Internet or Hot-Seat play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1630?t=1764279401","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1630?t=1764279401","capsule_im